# Skill: React Best Practices

Purpose:
  React and Next.js best practices skill. Contains 40+ rules covering
  rendering, state management, async patterns, bundle optimization,
  and server/client boundaries.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @SKILL.md
   3  @rules/_sections.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — apply best practice to current task
  REVIEW   — review React code against rules
  SCAN     — scan codebase for violations

Rules:
  [RBP1] Rules MUST be categorized by domain (rendering, async, bundle, server).
  [RBP2] Each rule MUST include rationale, anti-pattern, and fix.
  [RBP3] React API usage MUST target current stable version.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    SKILL.md
    rules/_sections.md

  Resolve:
    rules/rendering
    rules/rerender
    rules/async
    rules/bundle
    rules/server
    rules/client
    rules/js

Navigation:
  ReactBestPractices: @INDEX.sdd
  Skill: @SKILL.md
  Sections: @rules/_sections.md

State: +